---
description: Route through AGENTS.md and the docs/agents guides before any task
alwaysApply: true
---

Before any task, read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. It is an index: use its
orientation table to open the specific `docs/agents/<topic>.md` guide(s) for the
areas your task touches, before editing files in those areas. Do not bulk-read
every guide.

Step-by-step task recipes with guardrails live in `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
(verify-changes, write-test, commit-and-pr, add-config-attribute, add-cli-option,
touch-backend, ui-expose-attribute). When a task matches one, read it in full and
follow its numbered steps.
